  "title": "Unified Title",
  "summary": "ICML and REALM propose frameworks to address challenges in long-term memory management for LLM agents, enabling continuous improvement through interactive and reconsolidation mechanisms. Video understanding agents improve their evidence acquisition by harnessing evolution and utilizing EgoGears. Agent skills matter through inferred proprietary skills and hierarchical skill graphs, while harness evolution improves performance with budget-aware frameworks. VisualEvolve introduces a self-evolving framework for visual reasoning through a Select-Execute-Evolve-Evaluate cycle.",
